WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.958
Step 1: Open the location selector and choose Head Office. Authorised managers can create it by selecting this option if it is missing. It opens without a store setup checklist. Selecting a store shows its Store dashboard; Staff profiles keep an operational dashboard without sales.

2
00:00:14.958 --> 00:00:29.583
Step 2: On Head Office, choose accessible locations and a week. Use Daily or Weekly on the Sales leaderboard; gold, silver and bronze mark the top three places. Daily has its own date selector. Open a location row to see Reporting for those dates.

3
00:00:29.583 --> 00:00:40.167
Step 3: On a store dashboard, use Today and This hour for projected sales and labour budget, compare saved hourly sales, and review ordering, checklists, published staff shifts and quick links.

4
00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:51.375
Step 4: Use Edit Home on a computer to customise the company layout. Head Office, Store and Staff layouts are independent; existing custom sections and the company’s colours, fonts and logos are retained.
